  helpButtonText: {fileID: 7806540218172129639}
  helpTxt:
  - Touch a Lost item and swipe it with your finger. Match 3 items of the same color
    to clear them.
  - Match 4 or 5 items in different formations to generate boosters!
  - Combine busters by switching them with each other for enhance the effect
  - Work for a limited duration and unlock after reaching certain levels. Purchased
    before starting the game
